# AI Company — standup / meeting schedule (fallback path)
#
# PREFERRED: use Hermes' built-in scheduler so the CEO profile posts standup
# itself (keeps the soul/session in the loop). See MEETINGS.md §B and your
# Hermes docs. Use THIS crontab only where a native scheduler is unavailable.
#
# Times are in the crontab host's local timezone. company.discord.json declares
# meetings.timezone (Asia/Seoul); set the host TZ or adjust the fields below.
#
# Install:  crontab templates/cron/crontab.example
# Requires: DISCORD_STANDUP_TOKEN (or a filled ceo/.env) + a channel map from
#           `companyctl bootstrap`. Secrets stay in the environment, not here.

# Daily standup — weekdays 09:00 (company.discord.json meetings.standupCron)
0 9 * * 1-5  cd /path/to/ai-company-discord && python3 scripts/companyctl.py standup post

# Weekly exec-meeting reminder — Monday 10:00 (meetings.execMeetingCron).
# Currently a preview; wire to your own reminder once bootstrap has run.
# 0 10 * * 1  cd /path/to/ai-company-discord && python3 scripts/companyctl.py standup post --dry-run
